{"games":[{"id":14826163936,"name":"Space Pioneers [ALPHA 10]","desc":"The sky is no longer the limit! Traverse the galaxy to locate resources or meet your friends. Refine ores to build spacecraft, and increasingly elaborate industrial complexes. Explore thousands of stars and their countless planets.\n\nCreated by Calzymp\n\nAlpha 10:\nChangelog so massive I cant possibly list everything but I will summarize as:\nComplete universe rework from galaxies, nebulas, stars, planets, ect.\nNew ocean and desert plants.\nInterstellar Space and skybox overhaul/rework.\nData reset.","path":"/game/14826163936-space-pioneers","slug":"14826163936-space-pioneers","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7613e7b9d5525935e22bba371c6c6ff12553dd7dbae6e6a5ffb566f53a47b909.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e24a76410a1cc304375f8221d94225ca/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":29,"visitor":936953,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-15T12:13:47.193Z","creator":{"name":"Sidereal Productions","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":121455614269435,"name":"TGI - FPS Shot Exchange ","desc":"🎮 TGI FPS\n\nEnter a fictional urban arena FPS experience, created for fast matches, competitive action, and teamwork.\n\n🔥 Resources:\n✅ PVP combat on fictional urban maps \n✅ Fast and intense matches \n✅ Optimized for mobile, PC, and console \n✅ Weapon system for competitive gameplay \n✅ Alternative routes, alleys, and strategic points around the map \n\n⚠️ Game Rules: \n🚫 It is prohibited to use hacks, exploits, or any unfair advantages. \n✅ Play clean and respect other players \n\n🧠 Strategy, aim, and teamwork will determine victory. \n\nAll names, maps, teams, and situations in this experience are fictional and do not represent real locations, groups, organizations, actual events, or real forces.\n\nOwner: KainagamerTigre\nDevs: MYTZ87, Ell_Gorduxo, Oliver\n\nTags: FPS, PVP, Arena, Urban, Competitive, Mobile, Console, PC, TGI ","path